New stuff and surprises – if it could make your coffee too, Update 1.85:  The Trool Fair would be just about perfect! Well, don't get your hopes up, because lousy pigs will fly (without you giving them an uppercut) before that happens… Hurry up and check out what's waiting for you in the game!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/4461458/85c25a04ac998238941160dd8268093375201a73.png[/img]

We made it! And it looks like you did too! So in that case, Let's get on with it! Update 1.85 is online, which means it's time to drop whatever you were doing and jump right into the game to see what's waiting for you. Here's a taster:

The revamp of the Enutrof class;
Purchase offers;
Account entity decorations;
Trool Fair enhancements;
WAKFU HD;
And many other surprises for you to check out in the changelog… or directly in the game!

[url=www.wakfu.com/en/forum/199-changelogs/244639-trool-fair]READ THE CHANGELOG[/url]

ENJOY!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/4461458/ed1be1c61eb6109034855033eb75fe7cb2839cfb.jpg[/img]

WAKFU Update 1.69 is now online! You'll find loads of new additions and improvements, including:

improvements to the Mineral Tower;
an overhaul of the Masqueraider class, who've got more than one mask up their sleeves;
changes to the Rogue class;
and much more!

The list of all changes is [url=www.wakfu.com/en/forum/199-changelogs/240036-agony-unchained]available here[/url].

Join us on the game servers now to check out Update 1.69: Agony Unchained!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/4461458/3f64cad2dedc7b62904e21b8e6712c6e03da03dc.jpg[/img]

Update [b]1.68[/b] is online now! You'll find loads of new additions and improvements, including:

- the new [b]divine dimension, Osamosa[/b], where you'll encounter four new zones with four new monster families, as well as a host of new dungeons and resources;
- [url=www.wakfu.com/en/mmorpg/news/devblog/tickets/1186460-devblog-level-215-wakfu]level 215[/url] implemented in the game;
- the [b]Feca class revamp[/b];
[url=www.wakfu.com/en/forum/195-devblogs/239247-devblog-improved-enchantment]improvements to - the Enchantment system[/url];
- and the [b]new Eliocalypse quest[/b].

The list of all changes is [url=www.wakfu.com/en/mmorpg/news/patch-notes/1204907-osamosa/details]available here[/url].

[b]So join us on the game servers now to check out Update 1.68: Osamosa![/b]
